{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15100","headline":"秋晚溪中寄怀大理齐司直 · 李益","name":"秋晚溪中寄怀大理齐司直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤翔属明代，羽翼文葳蕤。\n崑仑进琪树，飞舞下瑶池。\n振仪自西睠，东夏复分厘。\n国典唯平法，伊人方在斯。\n荒岳宁桁杨肃，芳辉兰玉滋。\n明质鹜高景，飘颻服缨绥。\n天寒清洛苑，秋夕白云司。\n况复空岩侧，苍苍幽桂期。\n岁寒坐流霰，山川犹别离。\n浩思凭尊酒，氛氲独含辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15100.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15100","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}